    * **Noon (Savitri):** White color, Bull (Bail) vahan, Trident/Damru holding, Yajurveda connection, Bhuvarloka.[3]
    * **Evening (Saraswati):** Dark/Smoky color, Garuda vahan, Shankh-Chakra-Gada holding, Samaveda connection, Swarloka.[3]

