    1. Life Science (Aatma-gyan), 2\. Energy Collection (Health), 3\. Excellence (High principles), 4\. Truth (Satya), 5\. Sanyam, 6\. Service (Sewa), 7\. Duty, 8\. Sadbuddhi, 9\. Vivek.[10]

